{"sha": "32313780d470c1ee019464d168c12a43160d563c4438321086616c3323275481", "body": ["\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:fouriertransform:7}", "若 $\\hat f(\\xi) = O(\\abs\\xi^{-k-1-\\delta})$，则 $\\xi^j\\hat f", "\\in L^1$ 对 $0 \\leq j \\leq k$ 成立（无穷远处的可积性由", "衰减性推出，局部则由 $\\hat f$ 的连续性得到）。反演", "（\\cref{thm:b3:fouriertransform:inversion}(2)）表示 $f$，", "几乎处处由 $x \\mapsto \\frac1{2\\pi}\\int\\hat f(\\xi)\\eu^{\\iu", "x\\xi}\\dd\\xi$ 给出，积分号下的求导", "（控制函数为 $\\abs{\\xi^j\\hat f}$）使该代表元", "属于 $\\mathcal C^k$。反之，对 $f \\in \\mathcal C_c^k$：", "反复应用\\cref{prop:b3:fouriertransform:basic}(4)，", "$(\\iu\\xi)^k\\hat f = \\widehat{f^{(k)}}$，故 $\\abs{\\hat f} \\leq", "\\norm{f^{(k)}}_1\\abs\\xi^{-k}$。帐篷函数连续，", "且具紧支集（$k = 0$：变换有界），其", "变换 $\\sim \\xi^{-2} = O(\\abs\\xi^{-0-1-1})$ 由第一个方向，", "给出一个 $\\mathcal C^0$ 的代表元 --- 两者都是", "最优的：帐篷函数不属于 $\\mathcal C^1$，其变换", "的衰减不快于 $\\xi^{-2}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:fouriertransform:8}", "分部积分（$f \\in \\mathcal S$；边界项", "均为零）：", "\\[", "1 = \\int f^2 = \\bigl[xf^2\\bigr]_{-\\infty}^{\\infty} - \\int", "x\\,(f^2)' = -2\\int xff' \\leq 2\\,\\norm{xf}_2\\,\\norm{f'}_2 .", "\\]", "由普朗歇尔恒等式及 $\\widehat{f'} = \\iu\\xi\\hat f$：", "$\\norm{f'}_2^2 = \\frac1{2\\pi}\\int\\xi^2\\abs{\\hat f}^2$。将", "上式平方得：", "\\[", "\\frac14 \\leq \\norm{xf}_2^2\\cdot\\frac1{2\\pi}", "\\int\\xi^2\\abs{\\hat f}^2\\dd\\xi .", "\\]", "等号成立要求柯西–施瓦茨不等式取等，即 $f' =", "\\lambda xf$，其中 $\\lambda < 0$（由可积性），亦即 $f(x) =", "c\\,\\eu^{\\lambda x^2/2}$：高斯函数。在", "$x$ 中集中（$\\norm{xf}_2$ 小）的信号，其频谱必须分散，且", "反之亦然，此即不确定性原理。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:fouriertransform:9}", "高斯函数 $f(x) = \\eu^{-\\pi tx^2}$ 属于施瓦茨函数类，故", "\\cref{thm:b3:fouriertransform:poisson} 适用，并且", "$\\hat f(\\xi) = t^{-1/2}\\eu^{-\\xi^2/4\\pi t}$。取 $\\xi = 2\\pi", "k$ 时右端化为 $t^{-1/2}\\eu^{-\\pi k^2/t}$，即", "theta 恒等式。取 $t = 1$：", "\\[", "\\sum_{n\\in\\Z}\\eu^{-\\pi n^2} = 1 + 2\\eu^{-\\pi} + 2\\eu^{-4\\pi} +", "\\cdots \\approx 1 + 0.0864278 + 0.0000070 = 1.0864348,", "\\]", "取三项即精确到小数点后 $6$ 位（$\\eu^{-9\\pi}", "\\approx 5\\cdot10^{-13}$）。当 $t = 10^{-2}$ 时，定义所给的", "级数需要 $\\eu^{-\\pi n^2/100} < 10^{-7}$，即 $n \\gtrsim", "23$ --- 约 $47$ 项 --- 而变换后的级数为", "$10\\sum_k\\eu^{-100\\pi k^2}$，其中 $k = 1$ 项", "已为 $\\sim 10^{-136}$，只取一项即可。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:fouriertransform:10}", "$\\mathcal Ff \\in L^2(\\intcc{-\\pi}\\pi) \\subseteq", "L^1(\\intcc{-\\pi}\\pi)$（有限测度），故反演给出", "连续代表元 $f(x) =", "\\frac1{2\\pi}\\int_{-\\pi}^\\pi\\mathcal Ff(\\xi)\\eu^{\\iu", "x\\xi}\\dd\\xi$，其中", "\\[", "f(n) = \\frac1{2\\pi}\\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi}\\mathcal", "Ff(\\xi)\\,\\eu^{\\iu n\\xi}\\dd\\xi = \\langle e_{-n}, \\mathcal", "Ff\\rangle", "\\]", "按\\cref{thm:b3:hilbert:fourier}的记号，", "在该希尔伯特基下展开：$\\mathcal Ff = \\sum_nf(n)\\,\\eu^{-\\iu", "n\\xi}$ 在 $L^2(\\intcc{-\\pi}\\pi)$ 中。对", "对 $L^2$ 连续的 $\\mathcal F^{-1}$ 逐项应用：", "\\[", "\\mathcal F^{-1}\\bigl(\\mathbf", "1_{\\intcc{-\\pi}\\pi}\\eu^{-\\iu n\\xi}\\bigr)(x)", "= \\frac1{2\\pi}\\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi}\\eu^{\\iu\\xi(x - n)}\\dd\\xi", "= \\frac{\\sin\\bigl(\\pi(x-n)\\bigr)}{\\pi(x - n)} ,", "\\]", "于是得到 $f = \\sum_nf(n)\\operatorname{sinc}(\\cdot - n)$，在", "$L^2$ 意义下：带限信号由其整数", "采样值唯一确定 --- 即香农采样定理。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:fouriertransform:11}", "(a) $\\mathcal S$ 上的反演：$f(x) =", "\\frac1{2\\pi}\\int\\hat f(\\xi)\\eu^{\\iu x\\xi}\\dd\\xi =", "\\frac1{2\\pi}(\\mathcal F\\hat f)(-x)$，即 $(\\mathcal", "F^2f)(x) = 2\\pi f(-x)$。两次应用得 $\\mathcal F^4f =", "2\\pi\\,\\mathcal F^2f(-\\cdot) = (2\\pi)^2f$.", "", "(b) 若 $\\mathcal Ff = \\lambda f$ 且 $f \\neq 0$：", "$(2\\pi)^2f = \\mathcal F^4f = \\lambda^4f$，故 $\\lambda^4 =", "(2\\pi)^2$：$\\lambda \\in \\{\\pm\\sqrt{2\\pi},", "\\pm\\iu\\sqrt{2\\pi}\\}$。高斯函数 $g(x) = \\eu^{-x^2/2}$ 满足", "$\\hat g = \\sqrt{2\\pi}\\,g$", "（\\cref{ex:b3:fouriertransform:gaussian} 中取 $a = \\frac12$）：", "以 $+\\sqrt{2\\pi}$ 为特征值的特征函数。", "", "(c) $\\mathcal F^2f = 2\\pi f(-\\cdot)$ 等于 $\\pm2\\pi f$，", "取决于奇偶性。令 $h(x) = x\\eu^{-x^2/2}$，", "对 $\\hat g(\\xi) = \\sqrt{2\\pi}\\eu^{-\\xi^2/2}$ 求导，", "利用 $\\widehat{xf} = \\iu\\frac{\\dd}{\\dd\\xi}\\hat f$：", "\\[", "\\hat h(\\xi) = \\iu\\,\\frac{\\dd}{\\dd\\xi}\\bigl(\\sqrt{2\\pi}", "\\eu^{-\\xi^2/2}\\bigr) = -\\iu\\sqrt{2\\pi}\\,\\xi\\eu^{-\\xi^2/2}", "= -\\iu\\sqrt{2\\pi}\\,h(\\xi) :", "\\]", "以 $-\\iu\\sqrt{2\\pi}$ 为特征值的特征函数。（埃尔米特", "函数延续这一模式，周而复始地经过四个", "特征值 --- 构成离散傅里叶“时钟”。）", ""]}